  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Title code of the KTITLE file: copies the colours to $d800 and shows the title picture in VIC bank 1. The loader calls it before it loads KMAIN."},
    {"at":36,"placement":"side","text":"Bit 0 of $dd00 = 0: with bit 1 = 1, the VIC-II uses bank 1 ($4000-$7fff)."},
    {"at":39,"placement":"side","text":"Bitmap mode on."},
    {"at":47,"placement":"side","text":"Multicolour mode on."},
    {"at":55,"placement":"side","text":"$d018 = $7c: screen at $5c00, bitmap at $6000."},
    {"at":63,"placement":"side","text":"Screen on."},
    {"at":72,"placement":"line","text":"Copies the 1000 bytes at title_colour_ram to the colour RAM at $d800, in 4 blocks of 250 bytes."}
  ],
